    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Bai Ning Bing stretches out her little finger, where Frost Arrow Gu resides as a blue tattoo. Icy blue vapor condenses into an arrow that strikes Yan Tu’s fiery claw and suppresses its flames. It establishes dominance once used.",
        "chapters": [
          313
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "battle-stage-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_yan_tu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "She later pairs Frost Breath Gu and Frost Arrow Gu to slow and restrain fiery snakes. When she needs to catch a retreating Yan Tu, she shoots frost arrows repeatedly; their cold frosty aura freezes muscles and blood and slows the target’s movement, though none of those arrows land on him.",
        "chapters": [
          313
        ],
